      "versionNonce": 64,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1717459200000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Legend\n────────────────────────────\nYellow  : enum\nBlue    : interface / abstract\nGreen   : concrete impl (state / strategy)\nLavender: domain model hierarchy\nOrange  : entity (copy / loan / member)\nPink    : factory\nRed     : singleton (system / service)\n\nSolid → : association / composition\nDotted →: implements / depends-on\n◇ →     : aggregation (owner side)",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "legend-box",
      "originalText": "Legend\n────────────────────────────\nYellow  : enum\nBlue    : interface / abstract\nGreen   : concrete impl (state / strategy)\nLavender: domain model hierarchy\nOrange  : entity (copy / loan / member)\nPink    : factory\nRed     : singleton (system / service)\n\nSolid → : association / composition\nDotted →: implements / depends-on\n◇ →     : aggregation (owner side)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.2
    }
  ],
